# A fallback check, used only for a repository with no registry entry of its own.
#
# It is empty on purpose, and should usually stay that way: one command cannot be
# right for every repository on this machine. The check that runs in a repository
# comes from its registry entry:
#
#   node scripts/repos.mjs scan <dir> --add     propose one per repository
#   node scripts/repos.mjs set <name> verify "npm run typecheck && npm test"
#   node scripts/repos.mjs check                run them all once, now
#
# A repository with no entry and no line here runs unverified: the post-edit
# hook stays silent, and a subagent is not blocked from reporting done. That is
# deliberate - a machine-wide install must not run some other project's test
# suite in a repository you only opened to read.
